OL,3,GNEWSALong delays after three-van crash
OL,4,Aon M25
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing long delays on the
OL,7,FM25 following a multi-vehicle crash,
OL,8,FNational Highways has said.
OL,10,FThe collision, which involved three
OL,11,Fvans, happened after junction 11 for
OL,12,Fthe A320 St Peter's Way in Chertsey on
OL,13,FTuesday at about 07:00 GMT, according
OL,14,Fto travel site Inrix.
OL,16,FThere are also delays reported from
OL,17,Fjunction 14, A3113 Airport Way.
OL,19,FNational Highways says there are delays
OL,20,Fof more than one hour anticlockwise on
OL,21,Fthe approach to the incident, with 7
OL,22,Fmiles (11.2km) of congestion.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
